{"kind":"article","metadata":{"title":"架构演进","modules":[{"name":"OrzMC"}],"roleHeading":"","role":"article"},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/orzmc\/architecture"]}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/com.joker.OrzMC\/documentation\/OrzMC\/Architecture"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.joker.OrzMC\/documentation\/OrzMC"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"本文档记录当前项目向可商业化产品演进的目标架构、已完成改造和后续迁移顺序。原则是先建立稳定边界，再逐步拆分模块，避免一次性重排 Xcode 工程造成不可控风险。"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"%E7%9B%AE%E6%A0%87%E5%88%86%E5%B1%82","text":"目标分层"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"OrzMC 后续建议稳定为以下模块：","type":"text"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OrzMCApp-macOS"},{"type":"text","text":"：macOS App 入口、窗口、菜单、系统集成和分发相关能力。"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OrzMCMobileHelper-iOS"},{"type":"text","text":"：iOS 辅助 App 入口和移动端界面。"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OrzMCProtocol"},{"type":"text","text":"：Minecraft SLP、Query、RCON 等协议编解码与网络访问。"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"OrzMCLauncher","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"：客户端\/服务端启动编排、Java 检测、进程管理、版本选择和进度事件。"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"OrzMCRemoteHosting","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"：exaroton 等远程托管服务集成。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OrzMCDesignSystem"},{"text":"：跨 macOS\/iOS 复用的视觉组件、格式化工具和空状态组件。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"OrzMCFoundation","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"：路径、日志、错误类型、平台能力适配等基础能力。","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"text":"当前已完成","type":"heading","anchor":"%E5%BD%93%E5%89%8D%E5%B7%B2%E5%AE%8C%E6%88%90","level":2},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"GameModel"},{"type":"text","text":" 不再直接构造 "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"GUIClient"},{"type":"text","text":" \/ "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"GUIServer"},{"text":"，启动编排已收敛到 ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"GameLaunchService"},{"type":"text","text":"。"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"GUIClient"},{"type":"text","text":" \/ "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"GUIServer"},{"type":"text","text":" 通过 "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"LaunchProgressHandler"},{"type":"text","text":" 上报进度，不再直接依赖 "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"GameModel"},{"type":"text","text":"。"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"LauncherServices.swift"},{"text":" 已改为 App 层适配器，Java 运行时判断、版本过滤、服务进程记录都委托给 ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OrzMCLauncher"},{"type":"text","text":"。"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"GameModel"},{"type":"text","text":" 不再持有全局服务端 PID 表，受管理服务进程状态已收敛到 "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ManagedServerProcessStore"},{"text":"，App 层仅负责把启动结果和系统进程列表同步进去。","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Paper 服务端插件批量下载已抽到 ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ServerPluginDownloadService"},{"text":"，","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"GameModel"},{"text":" 只负责下载进度状态和错误展示。","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Minecraft 版本目录加载和当前 Java 主版本解析已抽到 "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"GameCatalogService"},{"type":"text","text":" \/ "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"JavaRuntimeService"},{"type":"text","text":"，"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"GameModel"},{"type":"text","text":" 不再直接访问 Mojang manifest 或解析 JDK 版本字符串。"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"服务端进程扫描和停止命令已收敛到 ","type":"text"},{"code":"ServerProcessService","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"，","type":"text"},{"code":"GameModel","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" 不再直接调用系统 Shell。","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"App 层启动器服务已按职责拆成 ","type":"text"},{"code":"GameCatalogService","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"、","type":"text"},{"code":"GameLaunchService","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"、"},{"code":"JavaRuntimeService","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"、"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ServerProcessService"},{"text":"、","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ServerPluginDownloadService"},{"type":"text","text":"、"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"VersionFilterService"},{"type":"text","text":" 和 "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"LauncherTypes"},{"text":"，避免 ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"LauncherServices.swift"},{"text":" 继续膨胀。","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ServerProcessService"},{"type":"text","text":" 通过 "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ServerProcessCommanding"},{"type":"text","text":" 注入系统进程命令，默认使用 "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ShellServerProcessCommander"},{"type":"text","text":"；测试可用 fake commander 覆盖，后续可接入审计、重试或更安全的停止策略。"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"新增根目录 "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Package.swift"},{"type":"text","text":"，将核心能力逐步暴露为 SwiftPM products。"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OrzMCFoundation"},{"type":"text","text":" 已建立基础值类型边界，目前包含 "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ProcessIdentifier"},{"type":"text","text":"。"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OrzMCLauncher"},{"type":"text","text":" 已建立启动器领域边界，目前包含 Java 运行时判断、版本列表过滤、受管理服务进程记录。"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OrzMCProtocol"},{"type":"text","text":" 已将现有 "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OrzMC\/MobileHelper(iOS)\/Protocol"},{"type":"text","text":" 暴露为 SwiftPM target；Xcode App target 和 Xcode 单元测试已改为引用该 product，不再直接编译协议源码。"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OrzMCRemoteHosting"},{"type":"text","text":" 已建立远程托管服务抽象，目前包含远程服务器摘要、状态、动作和列表策略；exaroton 详情页动作可用性已接入该策略。"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OrzMCDesignSystem"},{"type":"text","text":" 已建立跨平台设计系统边界，目前包含内容状态模型和空状态组件；macOS 详情页未选择版本时已复用统一空状态。"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"已新增 SwiftPM 单元测试，让协议层、启动器规则、远程托管规则和设计系统状态可以脱离 App target 独立验证。"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"ExarotonServerDetail","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" 已拆出 ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ExarotonServerActionSection"},{"type":"text","text":"，详情页只负责页面组合和连接状态，服务器动作逻辑收敛到独立组件。"}]}]}]},{"text":"当前模块状态","type":"heading","anchor":"%E5%BD%93%E5%89%8D%E6%A8%A1%E5%9D%97%E7%8A%B6%E6%80%81","level":2},{"header":"row","type":"table","rows":[[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"模块"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"状态"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"说明"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OrzMCApp-macOS"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"现有 Xcode target"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"继续承载 App 生命周期、窗口、菜单、签名、公证、Sparkle 更新。"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OrzMCMobileHelper-iOS"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"现有 Xcode target + App 已引用协议模块"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"继续承载 iOS 辅助端界面；协议实现由 "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OrzMCProtocol"},{"type":"text","text":" 提供。"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OrzMCFoundation"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"SwiftPM product + App 已引用"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"已可独立构建和测试，并作为基础依赖进入 App target。"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OrzMCLauncher"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"SwiftPM product + macOS 已引用"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"已可独立构建和测试；App 中 "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"LauncherServices"},{"type":"text","text":" 已委托该模块，服务进程状态由 "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ManagedServerProcessStore"},{"type":"text","text":" 管理。"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OrzMCProtocol"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"SwiftPM product + App 已引用"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"已可独立构建和测试；当前复用现有协议源码路径，并作为 Xcode target 的单一协议来源。"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OrzMCRemoteHosting"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"SwiftPM product + App 已引用"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"已可独立构建和测试；exaroton 状态映射与动作策略已对接。"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OrzMCDesignSystem"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"SwiftPM product + App 已引用"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"已可独立构建和测试；macOS 空状态已接入。"}]}]]]},{"text":"迁移顺序","type":"heading","anchor":"%E8%BF%81%E7%A7%BB%E9%A1%BA%E5%BA%8F","level":2},{"type":"orderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"保持现有 Xcode App target 不变，先通过 SwiftPM 为稳定代码建立独立构建入口。","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"优先迁移协议层，因为它与 UI、CoreData、分发和平台窗口能力耦合最低。","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"LauncherServices.swift","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" 保持为 App 适配器；新增启动器规则和纯状态管理优先进入 ","type":"text"},{"code":"OrzMCLauncher","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"，再由适配器暴露给 UI。","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"exaroton 继续按“领域规则进入 ","type":"text"},{"code":"OrzMCRemoteHosting","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"，第三方 SDK 适配留在 App 层，复杂 UI 拆成组件”的方式推进。","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"iOS 辅助端协议源码已切换为 ","type":"text"},{"code":"OrzMCProtocol","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" product；后续 iOS 新功能只在 App 层引用协议模块，不再把协议源码重新加入 App target Sources。","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"text":"验证命令","type":"heading","anchor":"%E9%AA%8C%E8%AF%81%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"SwiftPM 模块验证：","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["xcrun swift test --scratch-path \/private\/tmp\/orzmc-spm-build"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"bash"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"macOS App target 验证：","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["xcodebuild test -project OrzMC.xcodeproj -scheme OrzMC -destination 'platform=macOS,arch=arm64' -derivedDataPath \/private\/tmp\/orzmc-arch-derived"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"bash"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"iOS App target 验证：","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["xcodebuild build -project OrzMC.xcodeproj -scheme OrzMC -sdk iphonesimulator -destination 'generic\/platform=iOS Simulator' -derivedDataPath \/private\/tmp\/orzmc-ios-derived"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"bash"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"本地验证 iOS 构建时，需要 Xcode 安装的 iOS Simulator SDK 与可用模拟器运行时版本匹配。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"维护规则","type":"heading","anchor":"%E7%BB%B4%E6%8A%A4%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99","level":2},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"新业务能力优先写在服务层或 SwiftPM 模块中，SwiftUI View 只负责展示、用户输入和导航。","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"GameModel","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" 只作为界面状态协调器，不再新增下载、启动、网络协议、文件系统扫描、进程表维护等重逻辑。","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"新增可复用能力时必须配套单元测试，优先放在对应 SwiftPM test target。","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"涉及签名、公证、自动更新、发布流程的逻辑保持在 App 层，不进入核心业务模块。","type":"text"}]}]}]}]}],"sections":[],"references":{"doc://com.joker.OrzMC/documentation/OrzMC":{"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/orzmc","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.joker.OrzMC\/documentation\/OrzMC","abstract":[],"type":"topic","title":"OrzMC","role":"collection"}}}